### ===================================================================
### Retail Management Backend - HTTP Request Collection
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. STORES ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get All Stores
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Store by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Add New Store
POST {{baseUrl}}/stores
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Midtown Tech Outlet",
  "addressLine1": "500 5th Avenue",
  "addressLine2": "Suite 210",
  "addressLine3": "New York, NY 10110"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. PRODUCTS ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Search Products (partial name and category filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/search?name=Galaxy&category=Mobile
Accept: application/json

###

### Search Products ("All category" / no category filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/search?name=Pro&category=All category
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Sony WH-1000XM6 Headphones",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": 429.99,
  "sku": "ACC-SNY-XM6"
}

###

### Update Product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 512GB",
  "category": "Mobile",
  "price": 1249.99,
  "sku": "MOB-SAM-S24U"
}

###

### Delete Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/15

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. INVENTORY ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Inventory by Store ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/store/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Search Inventory by Store, Name, and Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/store/1/search?name=Galaxy&category=Mobile
Accept: application/json

###

### Add / Upsert Inventory Record
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 3,
  "storeId": 1,
  "stockLevel": 50
}

###

### Update Stock Level for Product in Store
PUT {{baseUrl}}/inventory/store/1/product/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "stockLevel": 42
}

###

### Delete Inventory Record
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/inventory/store/1/product/15

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. ORDERS ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Validate Store Exists
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/validate/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Validate Non-existent Store
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/validate/999
Accept: application/json

###

### Place an Order (Find or create customer, check stock, decrement, persist order)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "storeId": 1,
  "customer": {
    "name": "Sarah Connor",
    "email": "sarah.connor@example.com",
    "phone": "+1-415-555-8899"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": 13,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. REVIEWS ENDPOINTS (MongoDB)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Create Product Review
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "customerName": "TechEnthusiast88",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Outstanding display, brilliant cameras, and all-day battery life!"
}

###

### Get Reviews by Product ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/product/1
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. ANALYTICS & REPORTS (MySQL Stored Procedures)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Monthly Sales for Each Store
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/monthly-sales?year=2025&month=3
Accept: application/json

###

### Aggregate Sales for Entire Company
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/company-sales?year=2025&month=3
Accept: application/json

###

### Top Selling Products By Category (note: month first, then year)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/top-products?month=3&year=2025
Accept: application/json
